<view class="pet-page"><view class="pet-room"><view class="window"><view class="cloud"></view></view><view class="plant"><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view></view><view class="big-pet"><view class="ear left decor"></view><view class="ear right decor"></view><view class="eye left decor"></view><view class="eye right decor"></view><text>⌁</text></view><view class="floor-shadow"></view><text class="pet-speech">{{paired ? '今天也一起待一会儿吧' : '情侣空间已结束，团子在这里休息'}}</text></view><view class="pet-panel"><text class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE CLOUD</text><view class="pet-title"><view><text>{{pet.name}}</text><text class="label">{{pet.kind}} · Lv.{{pet.level}}</text></view><text>{{pet.growth}} / 100</text></view><view class="pet-progress"><view class="decor" style="width: {{pet.growth}}%"></view></view><view class="pet-actions"><button class="press {{pet.fedToday ? 'done' : ''}}" data-action="feed" bindtap="action" disabled="{{!paired}}"><text>小饼干</text><text class="label">{{pet.fedToday ? '今天喂过了' : '喂食 +8'}}</text></button><button class="press {{pet.playedToday ? 'done' : ''}}" data-action="play" bindtap="action" disabled="{{!paired}}"><text>毛线球</text><text class="label">{{pet.playedToday ? '今天玩过了' : '玩耍 +8'}}</text></button></view><view class="pet-log"><text class="section-title">共同日志</text><view wx:for="{{pet.logs}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="decor"></view><text>{{item}}</text></view></view><text class="pet-note">没有断签惩罚，也不会因为没来而生病。成长只是对共同投入的轻轻回应。</text></view></view>
